OL,3,AGovernment set to double spending on
OL,4,Asocial media unit to #25m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe budget for a government
OL,7,Fcommunications team which uses social
OL,8,Fmedia ads and influencers to reach the
OL,9,Fpublic has almost doubled since Labour
OL,10,Fcame to power.
OL,12,FThe New Media Unit, set up in 2024, is
OL,13,Fset to spend #25m this year on
OL,14,Fpromoting government policies on
OL,15,FYouTube, TikTok and other platforms, a
OL,16,FFreedom of Information request by the
OL,17,FBBC has revealed.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
