OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGovernment set to double spending on
OL,4,Asocial media unit to #25m
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as Andy Burnham was forced to
OL,7,Fdefend his use of social media
OL,8,Finfluencers to engage with young
OL,9,Fpeople, after a row over a video with
OL,10,Fexplicit language that was recorded on
OL,11,Fthe steps of 10 Downing Street.
OL,13,FThe PM said the video was "not
OL,14,Facceptable" and the creator of it, Max
OL,15,FBalegde, had apologised and taken it
OL,16,Fdown.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
